   "en": "The baraita states: «Rabbi» Yehuda HaNasi «deems» it «prohibited» to bring two rams with the redemption money of a bull, «because there is no mixing.» The Gemara infers: «The reason» that he deems it prohibited is «because there is no mixing. But» had there «been mixing,» then according to Rabbi Yehuda HaNasi it would be «permitted.»"
